    {
      "id": "63b8886b-1187-4a5d-bb87-19f912012ef8",
      "name": "Sticky Note f680424d",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        270,
        -30
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Guards, fail closed\n\nEvery refusal throws and the message ends with \"Nothing was written.\"\n\n- Base id or table id malformed\n- Table id does not resolve in the base\n- No literal Company column, or Company is computed\n\nColumns whose name starts with _cc_ are ignored everywhere. Name is never used as a company column: on contacts tables it is the person.",
        "color": 3,
        "width": 740,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c7812376-602b-4dd5-a2bd-cfa0154be5db",
      "name": "Sticky Note 6f821bcd",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        930,
        -170
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The page loop\n\n100 records per page, write batches of 10 at 4 requests per second. Only counters survive a page: the row set is dropped before the next fetch. Counters live in workflow static data keyed by execution id and are deleted when the log row is written.\n\nWrites are plain PATCH updates by record id. Never an upsert. Build Date is a CREATED_TIME() formula and is never in a payload.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 1620,
        "height": 340
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "511591d0-00e1-4823-bb61-ef5d4081969e",
      "name": "Sticky Note 23f4a9b8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1150,
        -30
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What gets written\n\nSource value: Company, falling back to company_clean when Company is blank. The cleaned value is written to BOTH columns when company_clean is a writable text field, and to Company alone when it is aiText, a formula, or otherwise computed.\n\nQuarantine: a result under 3 characters, or a single generic word (home, shop, welcome, about, products, store, index, page, contact), is discarded and the row is left untouched.",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
